.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-step-record 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-step\-record \- Record that a step passed, refusing when its inputs changed since the paired check
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten step record\fR [\fB\-\-arg\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIstep\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record that a step passed, refusing when its inputs changed since the paired check
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-arg\fR \fI<arg>\fR
A value the step\*(Aqs verdict depends on beyond its inputs, keyed in order (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIstep\fR>
The step\*(Aqs name, as the consumer\*(Aqs step table declares it
